Value Required LOCAL_PORT (\S+)
Value SYSTEM (\S+)
Value Required CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value Required PORT (Port\s+\d+|\S+)

Start
  ^\s*System Name\s+Local Interface\b.*$$ -> NameFirst
  ^\s*(?:Local Interface|LocalIf)\s+.*$$ -> LocalFirst

NameFirst
  ^\s*${SYSTEM}\s+${LOCAL_PORT}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${PORT}\s*$$ -> Record

LocalFirst
  ^\s*${LOCAL_PORT}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${PORT}\s+${SYSTEM}\s*$$ -> Record
